DESCRIPTION:Jupiter is moving through your work-and-routine zone (house 6)
  and reaching across to touch your Venus\, tucked quietly in your house of
  rest and inner life (house 12). This is a slow stretch where daily habits
  bump against hidden desires — maybe you want more pleasure\, more ease
 \, more beauty\, but your schedule doesn't leave room. It's not urgent\, j
 ust a growing awareness. Let your routines expand a little to include what
  truly delights you\, even in small doses. → Where could you add five mi
 nutes of real enjoyment to an ordinary weekday?\n\n— Technical detail: J
 upiter within orb of opposition your Venus natal (house 12) · exact: 01/1
 0/26\n\n(until Oct 14)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
