DESCRIPTION:This Full Moon lands in your house of identity\, lighting up h
 ow you show up in the world\, while the Sun sits opposite in your house of
  partnerships. It's a moment to see clearly how your sense of self shows u
 p in relationships — are you compromising too much\, or finally standing
  your ground? Neptune is exactly here too\, softening the picture with dre
 amy uncertainty: you may feel unsure who you are versus who you become aro
 und others. Mars\, the ruler of this Moon\, sits in your work house but wa
 s born in your house of travel and beliefs — meaning discipline and dail
 y effort help translate confusion into clarity. Since this closes the cycl
 e from the New Moon of April 2026 in Aries\, revisit what you intended the
 n about yourself. → What part of your identity feels foggy right now\, a
 nd what would bring it into focus?\n\n— Technical detail: Full Moon · 3
 °37' Aries · house 1 · exact 26/09 18:49
