DESCRIPTION:Venus turns retrograde in your house of intimacy and shared re
 sources\, right where your Saturn and Pluto already live. This begins a pe
 riod of revisiting old patterns around trust\, closeness\, and what you gi
 ve versus what you receive in deep bonds. Avoid finalizing big financial o
 r intimate commitments now — instead\, look back at what these bonds hav
 e taught you. Old flames\, old debts\, or old emotional contracts may resu
 rface for review\, not necessarily renewal. → What pattern in closeness 
 are you finally ready to see clearly?\n\n— Technical detail: Venus retro
 grade · 8°29' Scorpio · house 8 · 03/10 09:15
