DESCRIPTION:For about six weeks\, Venus moves backward through your house 
 of intimacy and shared resources — the same house holding your Saturn an
 d Pluto. This is a deep-review period: old questions about trust\, vulnera
 bility\, debts (emotional or literal)\, and what you truly value in close 
 bonds return for a second look. Avoid signing new joint financial agreemen
 ts or diving into new intense relationships until Venus moves forward agai
 n. Instead\, use this time to understand what you've outgrown. → What ol
 d story about trust or intimacy are you ready to finally release?\n\n— T
 echnical detail: Venus retrograde · 8°29' Scorpio → 22°51' Libra · h
 ouse 8\n\n(until Nov 14)
